    "description": "Choose a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a> or weapon group with which you are proficient. You ignore a target's armor bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> when <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disarming\">Disarming</a> with such a weapon. Additionally, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>, once per encounter, you can grant yourself a +10 bonus on your attack roll when attempting to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarm\" title=\"Disarm\">Disarm</a> an opponent while using such a weapon.",
